In this course, you will learn to create an
Android app using the jetpack compose UI library.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:10.539
Along the way, you will learn about graph
algorithms and data structures.

00:00:10.539 --> 00:00:12.679
Ryan MK teaches this course.

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:16.520
He is a very experienced developer and instructor.

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:17.590
What's up everybody?

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:21.760
This is Ryan here, and I would like to welcome
you to my tutorial series on the graph Sudoku

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:23.339
application.

00:00:23.339 --> 00:00:27.820
This is an application I wrote primarily to
refine my understanding of graph data structures

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:33.430
and algorithms, and the new UI library on
Android jetpack compose.

00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:38.140
In this part of the series, I will Overview
The main goals and topics of the series and

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:41.950
