02:17:08.650 --> 02:17:13.310
Really the only thing crossing line does is
it basically makes it so that in the lambda

02:17:13.310 --> 02:17:18.710
function, which we will pass into this function
here, we're not allowed to write a return

02:17:18.710 --> 02:17:21.440
