02:17:21.440 --> 02:17:26.360
So in the most general sense here, what we're
doing is we're taking a preventative step,

02:17:26.360 --> 02:17:31.920
to avoid a situation where we might accidentally
return from within the lamda that we pass

02:17:31.920 --> 02:17:34.190
in here causing unexpected behavior.

